BIFRÖST REACH NODE
NOTICE

Copyright © 2026 Volmarr Wyrd.

Bifröst Reach Node is an open-source hardware and software project for
portable, intelligent, long-range cellular connectivity using Raspberry Pi
systems, cellular modems, external antennas, networking software, signal
analysis, and related hardware.

This project contains components licensed under multiple open-source
licenses.

